---
import { frontmatter } from '../../content/privacy.md';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title={frontmatter.title} description={frontmatter.description}>
  <article class="privacy-policy">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>
      Last updated: <span class="placeholder">[TO FILL: date]</span>
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      This website is run by{' '}
      <span class="placeholder">[TO FILL: full legal name / trading name]</span>
      , <span class="placeholder">[TO FILL: postal address]</span>, the data
      controller for the personal data described here. Contact:{' '}
      <span class="placeholder">
        [TO FILL: privacy@dataceam.com or jawad@dataceam.com]
      </span>
      . ICO registration number:{' '}
      <span class="placeholder">
        [TO FILL: if registered with the Information Commissioner's Office]
      </span>
      .
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Email correspondence.</strong> If you email us, we keep your
        name, email address and what you tell us.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Website analytics.</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics,
        which doesn't use cookies or collect personal data to identify you. It
        records aggregate figures such as page views, referrers and country.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>This site sets no cookies.</p>

    <h2>Why we use it, and on what legal basis</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        To reply to you — <strong>legitimate interests</strong> in responding to
        enquiries, or steps <strong>before entering a contract</strong> with
        you.
      </li>
      <li>
        To understand how the site is used, in aggregate —{' '}
        <strong>legitimate interests</strong>.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We don't sell your personal data, and we don't use it for automated
      decision-making.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Service providers that run the site and email:{' '}
        <span class="placeholder">[TO FILL: Cloudflare, email provider]</span>.
      </li>
      <li>
        With your agreement only: an AI data buyer, when you've asked to be
        introduced.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Some providers may process data outside the UK. Where they do, they rely
      on appropriate safeguards such as the UK International Data Transfer
      Agreement or adequacy regulations.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Enquiries: <span class="placeholder">[TO FILL: e.g. 24 months]</span>{' '}
        after our last contact, unless we start working together.
      </li>
      <li>
        Analytics: aggregate only, retained by Cloudflare under its own policy.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask to access, correct or delete your personal data, to restrict
      or object to how we use it, and to receive a copy in a portable format.
      Email <span class="placeholder">[TO FILL: contact email]</span>. We'll
      reply within one month.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you're unhappy with how we've handled your data, you can complain to
      the Information Commissioner's Office (
      <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/">ico.org.uk</a>).
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We'll update this page if anything changes and revise the "last updated"
      date.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
